# The Vivado project tree -- 154 MB of IP caches, .dcp netlists and generated
# HDL, every byte of it reproducible from tcl/ and rtl/ by `make bitstream`.
# What is worth keeping beside it is amoeba.bit, amoeba.hwh, timing.rpt and
# utilization.rpt, which are the artefacts you cannot regenerate without an
# hour of Vivado.
bit/*/proj/

